00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:39.292
I didn't know that actually.

00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:40.125
- No, I feel great.

00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:40.958
- Its been months, right?

00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:41.911
- Yeah.

00:03:41.911 --> 00:03:42.924
- That's amazing.

00:03:42.924 --> 00:03:43.757
- I know.

00:03:43.757 --> 00:03:45.990
- Do you feel like it? I
feel like I don't drink it.

